---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Lo mas popular
description: "Las guias mas utiles para empezar: puntera ancha, deportivas, sandalias, botas y opciones para niños."
eyebrow: Popular
permalink: /popular/
---
<div class="archive-grid">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
    {% if post.data.featured %}
      <article class="post-card">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">
          <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.imageAlt or post.data.title }}" loading="lazy">
          <div class="post-card-content">
            <div class="post-meta"><span>{{ post.data.category }}</span></div>
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</div>
